WEBVTT

00:00:27.830 --> 00:00:31.176
or that someone's going to come
and slit my dog's throat.

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:35.526
AG: Then she spent several months
covering the midterm elections nonstop,

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:37.435
and something happened to her.

00:00:37.459 --> 00:00:38.998
(Music)

00:00:39.022 --> 00:00:40.363
AHP: Oh, I burned out.

00:00:40.387 --> 00:00:41.636
(Music)

00:00:41.660 --> 00:00:43.876
AG: Burnout -- the sense of exhaustion

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:46.596
that doesn't go away
with a good night's rest

00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:48.836
or an annual vacation.

00:00:48.860 --> 00:00:50.124
AHP: I kind of went numb.

00:00:50.148 --> 00:00:53.866
I didn't feel like anything was exciting
that I wanted to cover.

00:00:53.890 --> 00:00:55.886
I didn't feel like I had any good ideas.

00:00:55.910 --> 00:00:57.576
I cried on Skype with my editor,

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:00.326
which is very out of character for me.